<title>UK: SEK sets NZ$150 million two-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>SEK sets NZ$150 million two-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Wako International (Europe) Ltd and IBJ International Plc.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SWEDISH EXPORT CREDIT CORP</p>
<p> AMT	  NZ$150 MLN  COUPON     7.80   MATURITY    29.SEP.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT    ISS PRICE  PAR    PAY DATE   *26.SEP.96</p>
<p> FEES	 0.52	  LISTING    NONE   PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	     DENOMS (K) 5	HOME CTRY   SWEDEN</p>
<p> NOTES     *LONG FIRST COUPON.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
